8. Localize engine execution state and formalize ActionResult production in domain/infrastructure services
    [ ] 'content/app/presentation.py': Strip method logic and define static message members on ActionResult
        - Remove 'get_msg' method from ActionResult (no methods on class)
        - Add static string members:
            - BOOTSTRAP_SUCCESS = "Bootstrap completed successfully"
            - SELECTION_CLEARED = "Selection cleared"
            - NO_PROMPT_BOUND = "No prompt assigned to key '{key}'"
            - UNBOUND_KEY = "No action bound to key '{key}'"
            - DOMAIN_SELECTED = "Domain '{domain}' on key '{key}' selected"
            - DOMAIN_NONE_SELECTED = "Domain 'None' on key '{key}' selected"
            - COPIED_TO_CLIPBOARD = "Copied {lines} lines ({chars} chars) to clipboard"

    [ ] KBService Producer Methods ('content/keyboard/keyboard_service.py'):
        - handle_key: Return ActionResult.UNBOUND_KEY (formatted with key) for unbound actions
        - _set_selected_num_btn: Return ActionResult.DOMAIN_SELECTED, ActionResult.DOMAIN_NONE_SELECTED, or ActionResult.SELECTION_CLEARED
        - _create_render_context: Return ActionResult.NO_PROMPT_BOUND (formatted with key) when prompt inhabitant missing

    [ ] TUIService Producer Method ('content/tui/tui_service.py'):
        - to_clipboard: Return ActionResult using COPIED_TO_CLIPBOARD formatted with line and character counts

    [ ] IngestionService Producer Method ('content/asset_ingestion/ingestion_service.py'):
        - get_runtime_config (via error collector / bootstrap flow): Return ActionResult.BOOTSTRAP_SUCCESS

    [ ] RenderService Consumer Method ('content/render_pipeline/render_service.py'):
        - render_ui: Pass raw action_res.message to ContentShaper for padding/width adjustment instead of calling get_msg()

    [ ] ContentShaper Formatting ('content/render_pipeline/content_shaper.py'):
        - Add method shape_action_result(msg: str, width: int = 117) -> str to pad/truncate action result string to 117 characters

    [ ] AppEngine State Localization ('content/app/engine.py'): Eliminate self.msg instance attribute
        - Remove self.msg initialization from AppEngine.__init__
        - Capture IngestionService's ActionResult in run() method scope as local variable action_res
        - Pass action_res locally to renderer.render_ui(ui_render_ctx, action_res)
        - Reassign action_res locally from KBService.handle_key and TUIService.to_clipboard loop results
              
